<section class="two-thirds-white-box">
	<h1>Questions, Feature Requests, Reporting Errors</h1>

	<p>
		We welcome feedback. Many of the features on Memverse were implemented in response to feedback from users.
		The best place for asking questions, requesting new features, and reporting bugs is our support forum.
		We monitor it daily and there are often users online who can give a quick answer.
		Visit the <a href="/forum/feedback">feedback board</a> to get started.
	</p>

</section>

<section class="one-third-white-box">
	<h1>Newsletter</h1>

	<p>Phil Walker has graciously offered to write a periodic newsletter. It will include tips on how to use Memverse, recent changes to the website, and
	encouragement for those times when the weeds of life press in.</p>

</section>

